Layer 2: The Transaction Core (Fact Table)
Now look at Volume_Submissions.
This is your fact table. The star schema center. Every analysis starts here.
Look at the structure:

Who: CountryID, SubmittedBy, ValidatedBy (links to dimensions)
What: TestTypeID (links to dimension)
When: SubmissionMonth, SubmittedDate
How Much: ActualVolume, BudgetVolume, ForecastVolume (your measures)
Status: Draft → Submitted → Validated → Approved (workflow)
Quality: IsEstimate, DataQualityScore (metadata)

What you've done before:
