Approach 2: Narrow Format (What You Did - "Ledger")
Submission_History table (alternative):
HistoryID | SubmissionID | LedgerType | PreviousValue | NewValue
1         | 523          | Actual     | NULL          | 1000
2         | 523          | Actual     | 1000          | 950
3         | 523          | Budget     | 5000          | 5200
