## The Trade-Off Decision Matrix

| Factor | Wide Format (My Design) | Narrow Format (Your Approach) |
|--------|------------------------|------------------------------|
| **Rows per change event** | Fewer (1 row per event) | More (1 row per measure) |
| **NULL values** | Many (sparse) | Few (dense) |
| **Adding new measures** | Schema change required | No schema change |
| **Query complexity** | Simpler for events | Simpler for measure analysis |
| **UI display** | Easier (one gallery item) | Harder (need grouping) |
| **Storage efficiency** | Lower (many NULLs) | Higher (few NULLs) |
| **Common in** | OLTP systems, audit trails | OLAP systems, data warehouses |

