Soft Delete: The Simple Concept
Hard Delete (What Most People Do - WRONG):
sqlDELETE FROM Volume_Submissions 
WHERE SubmissionID = 523
Record is gone forever.

Soft Delete (What Enterprise Systems Do - RIGHT):
sqlUPDATE Volume_Submissions 
SET 
