**Never physically delete transactional data.**

**Always soft delete:**
- ✅ Volume_Submissions
- ✅ Any data that affects financial reports
- ✅ Any data with child relationships
- ✅ Any data subject to audit

**Can physically delete:**
- ❌ Draft submissions older than 90 days (cleanup job)
- ❌ System logs older than 1 year (retention policy)
- ❌ Temporary/cache data

